### ==================== Complaint Types ====================

### Get all complaint types
GET http://localhost:9999/pick-location/api/v1/complaint-types/all
Accept: application/json

### Get complaint type by ID
GET http://localhost:9999/pick-location/api/v1/complaint-types/1
Accept: application/json

### Create complaint type
POST http://localhost:9999/pick-location/api/v1/complaint-types/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "complaintName": "شكوى مياه"
}

### Update complaint type
PUT http://localhost:9999/pick-location/api/v1/complaint-types/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "complaintName": "شكوى مياه شرب"
}

### Delete complaint type
DELETE http://localhost:9999/pick-location/api/v1/complaint-types/1


### ==================== Neighborhoods ====================

### Get all neighborhoods
GET http://localhost:9999/pick-location/api/v1/neighborhoods/all
Accept: application/json

### Get neighborhood by ID
GET http://localhost:9999/pick-location/api/v1/neighborhoods/1
Accept: application/json

### Create neighborhood
POST http://localhost:9999/pick-location/api/v1/neighborhoods/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "neighborhoodName": "الحي الأول"
}

### Update neighborhood
PUT http://localhost:9999/pick-location/api/v1/neighborhoods/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "neighborhoodName": "الحي الثاني"
}

### Delete neighborhood
DELETE http://localhost:9999/pick-location/api/v1/neighborhoods/1


